For Bedrock specifically, I need the sub-agent to check service-specific credentials created for bedrock.amazonaws.com via the service-specific credential APIs, cross-referencing access (through attached Bedrock-related policies) with last-used timestamps from the access key and credential APIs, supplementing with CloudTrail lookups if needed for more reliable usage data.

